      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795798837539,
      "created": 1795798837537,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Target\n\n99.9% monthly\n\np95 under 200 ms (excl. models)\n\np95 under 3 s\n\n1,000 concurrent runs\n\nNo accepted run lost\n\nRPO 5 min, RTO 30 min\n\n$2 default cap per run\n\n90% or more task success\n\nSOC 2, GDPR, data residency\n\n100% of runs traced",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Target\n\n99.9% monthly\n\np95 under 200 ms (excl. models)\n\np95 under 3 s\n\n1,000 concurrent runs\n\nNo accepted run lost\n\nRPO 5 min, RTO 30 min\n\n$2 default cap per run\n\n90% or more task success\n\nSOC 2, GDPR, data residency\n\n100% of runs traced",
